══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  NODE: service.github
  Category: service
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  Create issues, PRs, or fetch repo data from GitHub

  Config example:
    { "credential_id": "github-token", "operation": "create_issue", "owner": "myorg", "repo": "myrepo", "title": "{{ $json.title }}", "body": "{{ $json.body }}" }

  Inputs:   item with issue/PR data
  Outputs:  issue_number, html_url

  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Credential platform: github

  Fields (every operation):
    credential_id        GitHub Account · credential_picker · required
    operation            Operation · select · required · default="list_repos"
                         shown when resource is (not set)
    resource             Resource · select · default="" · options: |issue|file|organization|pullRequest|release|repository|review|user|workflow
                         Leave empty for the built-in operations; pick a resource for the GitHub API package operations.
    operation            Issue Operation · select · required · default="create"
                         shown when resource is issue
    operation            File Operation · select · required · default="create"
                         shown when resource is file
    operation            Organization Operation · select · required · default="getRepositories"
                         shown when resource is organization
    operation            Pull Request Operation · select · required · default="create"
                         shown when resource is pullRequest
    operation            Release Operation · select · required · default="create"
                         shown when resource is release
    operation            Repository Operation · select · required · default="getIssues"
                         shown when resource is repository
    operation            Review Operation · select · required · default="create"
                         shown when resource is review
    operation            User Operation · select · required · default="getRepositories"
                         shown when resource is user
    operation            Workflow Operation · select · required · default="dispatch"
                         shown when resource is workflow
    owner                Repository owner · text · required
                         User or organization (resource locator or name)
                         shown when resource is issue|file|pullRequest|release|repository|review|workflow
    repository           Repository · text · required
                         shown when resource is issue|file|pullRequest|release|repository|review|workflow
    title                Title · text
                         shown when resource is issue|pullRequest
    body                 Body · textarea · default=""
                         shown when resource is issue|pullRequest|review
    labels               Labels · code · default=[]
                         [{"label": "bug"}]
                         shown when resource is issue
    assignees            Assignees · code · default=[]
                         [{"assignee": "octocat"}]
                         shown when resource is issue
    issueNumber          Issue number · number · default=0
                         shown when resource is issue
    body                 Comment · textarea
                         shown when resource is issue|pullRequest
    editFields           Edit fields · code · default={}
                         labels: [{label}]; assignees: [{assignee}] Keys: assignees, body, labels, state, state_reason, title
                         shown when resource is issue
    lockReason           Reason · select · default="resolved" · options: off-topic|too heated|resolved|spam
                         shown when resource is issue
    filePath             File path · text
                         shown when resource is file
    binaryData           Send binary file · boolean · default=false
                         shown when resource is file
    fileContent          File content · textarea · default=""
                         shown when resource is file
    binaryPropertyName   Input binary property · text · default="data"
                         shown when resource is file
    commitMessage        Commit message · text
                         shown when resource is file
    additionalParameters Additional parameters · code · default={}
                         author/committer: {name, email}; branch: {"branch": "main"} Keys: author, branch, committer
                         shown when resource is file
    asBinaryProperty     As binary property · boolean · default=true
                         shown when resource is file
    binaryPropertyName   Output binary property · text · default="data"
                         shown when resource is file
    additionalParameters Additional parameters · code · default={}
                         Keys: reference
                         shown when resource is file
    filePath             Folder path · text · default=""
                         shown when resource is file
    owner                Organization · text · required
                         User or organization (resource locator or name)
                         shown when resource is organization
    returnAll            Return all · boolean · default=false
                         shown when resource is organization|release|repository|review|user
    limit                Limit · number · default=50
                         shown when resource is organization|release|repository|review|user
    base                 Base branch · text
                         shown when resource is pullRequest
    head                 Head branch · text
                         branch or owner:branch
                         shown when resource is pullRequest
    draft                Draft · boolean · default=false
                         shown when resource is pullRequest
    pullRequestNumber    Pull request number · number · default=0
                         shown when resource is pullRequest|review
    editFields           Edit fields · code · default={}
                         Keys: title, body, state, base
                         shown when resource is pullRequest
    commentId            Comment ID · number · default=0
                         shown when resource is pullRequest
    mergeMethod          Merge method · select · default="merge" · options: merge|squash|rebase
                         shown when resource is pullRequest
    commitTitle          Commit title · text · default=""
                         shown when resource is pullRequest
    commitMessage        Commit message · textarea · default=""
                         shown when resource is pullRequest
    releaseTag           Tag · text
                         shown when resource is release
    additionalFields     Additional fields · code · default={}
                         Keys: name, body, draft, prerelease, target_commitish
                         shown when resource is release
    release_id           Release ID · text
                         shown when resource is release
    additionalFields     Additional fields · code · default={}
                         Keys: body, draft, name, prerelease, tag_name, target_commitish
                         shown when resource is release
    getRepositoryIssuesFilters Filters · code · default={}
                         Keys: assignee, creator, mentioned, labels, since, state, sort, direction
                         shown when resource is repository
    getRepositoryPullRequestsFilters Filters · code · default={}
                         Keys: state, sort, direction
                         shown when resource is repository
    event                Event · select · default="approve" · options: approve|requestChanges|comment|pending
                         shown when resource is review
    additionalFields     Additional fields · code · default={}
                         Keys: commitId
                         shown when resource is review
    reviewId             Review ID · text
                         shown when resource is review
    owner                User · text
                         User or organization (resource locator or name)
                         shown when resource is user
    getUserIssuesFilters Filters · code · default={}
                         Keys: mentioned, labels, since, state, sort, direction
                         shown when resource is user
    organization         Organization · text
                         shown when resource is user
    email                Email · text
                         shown when resource is user
    workflowId           Workflow ID or file name · text
                         shown when resource is workflow
    ref                  Branch or tag · text · default="main"
                         shown when resource is workflow
    inputs               Inputs (JSON) · code · default="{}"
                         shown when resource is workflow
    options              Options · code
                         limitWaitTime: {values: {limitType: afterTimeInterval (resumeAmount, resumeUnit) or atSpecifiedTime (maxDateAndTime)}} gives up waiting and passes the input items on
                         shown when resource is workflow

  Operations (operation):
    list_repos  (default)
      no further fields
    list_issues
      owner                Repository Owner · text
                           e.g. octocat
      repo                 Repository · resource_picker
      state                State · select · options: open|closed|all
                           Filter for list_issues/list_prs (open, closed or all); the new state for update_issue (open or closed). Empty uses GitHub's default.
    get_issue
      owner                Repository Owner · text
                           e.g. octocat
      repo                 Repository · resource_picker
      number               Issue/PR Number · number
    create_issue
      owner                Repository Owner · text
                           e.g. octocat
      repo                 Repository · resource_picker
      title                Issue/PR Title · text
      body                 Body · textarea
      labels               Labels · array
                           Label names to set on the issue. On update_issue they replace the existing labels.
    update_issue
      owner                Repository Owner · text
                           e.g. octocat
      repo                 Repository · resource_picker
      number               Issue/PR Number · number
      state                State · select · options: open|closed|all
                           Filter for list_issues/list_prs (open, closed or all); the new state for update_issue (open or closed). Empty uses GitHub's default.
      title                Issue/PR Title · text
      body                 Body · textarea
      labels               Labels · array
                           Label names to set on the issue. On update_issue they replace the existing labels.
    list_prs
      owner                Repository Owner · text
                           e.g. octocat
      repo                 Repository · resource_picker
      state                State · select · options: open|closed|all
                           Filter for list_issues/list_prs (open, closed or all); the new state for update_issue (open or closed). Empty uses GitHub's default.
    create_pr
      owner                Repository Owner · text
                           e.g. octocat
      repo                 Repository · resource_picker
      title                Issue/PR Title · text
      body                 Body · textarea
      head                 Head Branch · text
      base                 Base Branch · text
    list_releases
      owner                Repository Owner · text
                           e.g. octocat
      repo                 Repository · resource_picker
    create_release
      owner                Repository Owner · text
                           e.g. octocat
      repo                 Repository · resource_picker
      body                 Body · textarea
      tag_name             Tag Name · text
      release_name         Release Name · text

